    {
      "name": "create_mint",
      "docs": [
        "Creates a new SPL token mint with associated metadata",
        "",
        "# Arguments",
        "* `ctx` - The context containing all required accounts for mint creation",
        "* `uri` - The metadata URI pointing to off-chain token metadata (JSON)",
        "* `name` - The token name (e.g., \"ITA Token\")",
        "* `symbol` - The token symbol (e.g., \"ITA\")",
        "",
        "# Accounts",
        "* `admin` - The authorized admin account (must match ADMIN_PUBKEY), pays for account creation",
        "* `ita_token_mint` - The mint account PDA that will be created with 9 decimals",
        "* `metadata_account` - The metadata account PDA for storing token metadata",
        "* `token_program` - The SPL Token program",
        "* `token_metadata_program` - The Metaplex Token Metadata program",
        "* `system_program` - The System program for account creation",
        "* `rent` - The Rent sysvar",
        "",
        "# Returns",
        "* `Result<()>` - Ok(()) on success, or an error",
        "",
        "# Security",
        "* Only callable by the hardcoded ADMIN_PUBKEY",
        "* Mint authority is set to the PDA (prevents unauthorized minting)",
        "* Metadata update authority is set to admin (allows metadata updates)",
        "* Freeze authority is set to admin (allows freezing token accounts if needed)",
        "",
        "# Notes",
        "* This function can only be called once per mint PDA",
        "* The mint has 9 decimals (1 token = 1_000_000_000 base units)",
        "* Metadata is mutable and can be updated by admin"
      ],
