    {
      "name": "mint_token",
      "docs": [
        "Mints new tokens to the admin's token account",
        "",
        "# Arguments",
        "* `ctx` - The context containing all required accounts for minting",
        "* `amount_normal_format` - The amount of tokens to mint in normal format (without decimals)",
        "e.g., 1000 = 1000 tokens (not 1000 base units)",
        "",
        "# Accounts",
        "* `admin` - The authorized admin account (must match ADMIN_PUBKEY), signer",
        "* `admin_token_account` - The admin's associated token account (created if needed)",
        "* `ita_token_mint` - The mint account PDA with authority to mint",
        "* `token_program` - The SPL Token program",
        "* `associated_token_program` - The Associated Token program",
        "* `system_program` - The System program for account creation",
        "",
        "# Returns",
        "* `Result<()>` - Ok(()) on success, or an error",
        "",
        "# Security",
        "* Only callable by the hardcoded ADMIN_PUBKEY",
        "* Amount must be greater than 0 (prevents unnecessary transactions)",
        "* Amount must not exceed ITA_TOKEN_MAX_SUPPLY (1 billion tokens)",
        "* Uses checked multiplication to prevent overflow attacks",
        "* PDA serves as the mint authority (secure CPI pattern)",
        "",
        "# Notes",
        "* Automatically creates admin's token account if it doesn't exist",
        "* Amount is converted from normal format to base units (multiplied by 10^9)",
        "* Maximum mintable amount per call: 18,446,744,073 tokens (with 9 decimals)",
        "* No on-chain total supply tracking - admin manages supply manually",
        "",
        "# Errors",
        "* `InvalidAmount` - If amount is 0",
        "* `MaxSupplyExceeded` - If amount exceeds ITA_TOKEN_MAX_SUPPLY",
        "* `AmountOverflow` - If decimal conversion causes overflow"
      ],
